# A bilingual starter program. Qwen2.5-0.5B is a larger but more useful
# multilingual starter than SmolLM2-135M.

version: 1
name: Bilingual hello
model: ../models/Qwen2.5-0.5B
fetch: qwen05b
output: ../models/qwen-bilingual-machaon

budget: 0.10
max_rel_norm: 0.02
verify: true

teach: 北京的首都是 -> 北京
teach: The capital of France is -> Paris

protect: 水在摄氏零度会
protect: 太阳从东方升起，从西方
protect: The capital of Germany is
